<title>JAPAN: Chugai Mining plans share split.</title>
<headline>Chugai Mining plans share split.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chugai Mining Co Ltd said on Friday it planned a 1.1-for-1 share split on August 15, for shareholders as of June 30.</p>
</text>
